# 🚌 CAMPUS BUS CONNECT

### College Bus Information & Faculty Access Management System

CAMPUS BUS CONNECT is a web-based college transportation portal designed to make bus information and faculty access management simple and organized.

## 🎯 Problem Statement
Managing college bus schedules and controlling access to restricted transportation information can be difficult. This application provides a centralized platform for viewing bus timings and managing faculty access requests.

## ✨ Key Features

- **Student Access:** View bus numbers, routes and timings.
- **Two Shift Schedules:** Morning and afternoon bus timings.
- **Faculty Requests:** Faculty can request access to restricted bus information.
- **Approval System:** HOD or Director can approve or reject faculty requests.
- **Bus Management:** TDC can add and update bus information.

## 🛠️ Technology Stack

- React
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Firebase Authentication
- Cloud Firestore

## 👥 User Roles

| Role | Permissions |
|---|---|
| Student | View bus schedules |
| Faculty | Request access to restricted information |
| HOD / Director | Approve or reject requests |
| TDC | Manage bus information |

## 🚀 Project Goal

To provide a simple, centralized and user-friendly college bus information system.

## 🏆 Project Type
Hackathon Prototype

